toring#thresholds","content":"Spam Complaint Rate"},"6322":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-107","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 0.1%"},"6323":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-108","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 0.3%"},"6324":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-109","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"Delivery Failure Rate"},"6325":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-110","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 5%"},"6326":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-111","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 15%"},"6327":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-112","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"Score Drop (24h)"},"6328":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-113","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 15 points"},"6329":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-114","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 30 points"},"6330":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-115","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#auto-resolution","content":"Incidents automatically resolve when the triggering metric returns below its warning threshold. You do not need to manually close incidents. The resolution is noted in the incident history with a timestamp."},"6331":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-116","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Clean your contact list.** Remove addresses that have hard-bounced. NorthRelay automatically adds hard bounces to your suppression list."},"6332":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-117","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Use double opt-in.** Require email confirmation before adding contacts to your list."},"6333":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-118","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Validate emails at collection.** Use email syntax validation on signup forms."},"6334":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-119","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Remove inactive subscribers.** Contacts who have not engaged in 6+ months are more likely to become invalid."},"6335":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-120","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Only send to opted-in recipients.** Never purchase email lists."},"6336":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-121","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Include a visible unsubscribe link.** Make it easy to opt out -- this reduces complaints."},"6337":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-122","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Set expectations at signup.** Tell subscribers what content they will receive and how often."},"6338":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-123","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Honor unsubscribes immediately.** Process opt-outs within the same sending cycle."},"6339":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-124","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Segment your audience.** Send relevant content to each group rather than blasting everyone."},"6340":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-125","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check your DNS configuration.** Use the Pre-Flight Check to validate SPF, DKIM, and DMARC records."},"6341":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-126","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Verify your sending domain.** Unverified domains have lower trust with receivers."},"6342":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-127","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check the Blocklist Monitor.** Your IP or domain may be listed on a blocklist."},"6343":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-128","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Reduce sending volume temporarily.** If you are being throttled, slow down and gradually ramp back up."},"6344":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-129","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Check for new incidents.** The incidents panel will tell you which metric triggered the drop."},"6345":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-130","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Review recent sending activity.** Did you send to a new or untested list?"},"6346":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-131","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Check for infrastructure issues.** Use the Connectivity Doctor to verify SMTP connectivity."},"6347":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-132","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Warm up new domains gradually.** Start with small volumes (100-500/day) and increase over 2-4 weeks."},"6348":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-133","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Monitor your dashboard weekly.** Catch trends before they become incidents."},"6349":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-134","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Keep bounce rate under 2%.** This is the industry standard for healthy sending."},"6350":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-135","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Keep complaint rate under 0.08%.** Gmail's threshold for filtering is 0.1%."},"6351":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-136","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Segment by engagement.** Send more frequently to engaged contacts, less to inactive ones."},"6352":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-137","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Authenticate everything.** SPF, DKIM, and DMARC should all pass for every email."},"6353":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-138","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Diagnostic Tools for troubleshooting delivery issues"},"6354":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-139","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Domain Verification for setting up proper authentication"},"6355":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-140","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Sending Infrastructure for how NorthRelay protects its sending IP"},"6356":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-141","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Plans & Pricing for tier-specific reputation features"},"6357":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","type":"page","content":"Sending Infrastructure","breadcrumbs":["NorthRelay Documentation","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system"},"6358":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-0","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","content":"How NorthRelay delivers your mail from one protected IP"},"6359":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-1","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#sending-infrastructure","content":"Sending Infrastructure"},"6360":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-2","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"One relay for everyone"},"6361":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-3","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"How we protect its reputation"},"6362":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-4","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"What changes between tiers"},"6363":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-5","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#upgrading","content":"Upgrading"},"6364":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-6","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#previously-the-two-pool-system","content":"Previously: the Two-Pool system"},"6365":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-7","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#sending-infrastructure","content":"> One clean relay, actively protected, shared by every tier."},"6366":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-8","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"Every message you send through NorthRelay — on any plan, from any sender domain — leaves through a single sending relay:"},"6367":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-9","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"**Hostname**"},"6368":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-10","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"`sovereign.north-pipe.ca`"},"6369":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-11","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"**IPv4**"},"6370":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-12","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"`76.13.27.101`"},"6371":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-13","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"**HELO**"},"6372":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-14","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"`sovereign.north-pipe.ca`"},"6373":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-15","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"**SPF include**"},"6374":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-16","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"`include:_spf.north-pipe.ca`"},"6375":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-17","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"You connect to `smtp.north-pipe.ca` (or the REST API); NorthRelay queues your message and hands it to the relay, which signs it with DKIM and delivers it to the recipient's mail server. There is nothing to choose and nothing to configure — the path is the same for every account."},"6376":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-18","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"A single IP only works if it stays clean. These protections are enforced in code on every message:"},"6377":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-19","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Verified-From policy** — you can only send from a domain you have added and verified in your dashboard (or a subdomain of one). Requests from any other address are rejected with `403 FORBIDDEN_SENDER` and a message telling you which domain to verify. Nobody can spoof a domain they don't own."},"6378":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-20","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**One-click unsubscribe** — every marketing and campaign message carries RFC 8058 `List-Unsubscribe` headers, so recipients can opt out with one click instead of reporting spam."},"6379":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-21","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Bounce and complaint suppression** — hard bounces and spam complaints are added to your suppression list automatically and never mailed again."},"6380":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-22","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Hourly delivery canary** — every hour NorthRelay sends a real message through the full sending path to a monitored mailbox and checks that it arrives with SPF, DKIM and DMARC passing. If it fails or goes stale, our team is alerted."},"6381":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-23","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Full authentication alignment** — the relay signs with DKIM for your verified domain, `include:_spf.north-pipe.ca` covers SPF for IPv4 and IPv6, and both align with DMARC. See DNS Setup."},"6382":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-24","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Plans differ in limits and features, not in where your mail comes from:"},"6383":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-25","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Tier"},"6384":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-26","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Price (CAD/mo)"},"6385":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-27","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Emails/Month"},"6386":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-28","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Custom domains"},"6387":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-29","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Inbox cap"},"6388":{"